port, and personalized counseling to help you study at leading universities around the world.\",\"primaryCtaText\":\"Book a Free Consultation\",\"primaryCtaUrl\":\"/book-appointment\",\"secondaryCtaUrl\":\"/destinations\",\"heroImage\":\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1523240795612-9a054b0db644?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80\",\"floatingBadgeCategory\":\"Top Universities\",\"floatingBadgeTitle\":\"Top Universities in Australias\",\"floatingBadgeHighlight\":\"Group of Eight (Go8)\",\"floatingBadge1Value\":\"99.6% Success\",\"floatingBadge1Label\":\"Visa Granted Record\",\"floatingBadge2Value\":\"Top 1% Global\",\"floatingBadge2Label\":\"Ivy & Russell Group\",\"slides\":[{\"url\":\"/uploads/hero_australia_sydney_1920x1080.jpg\"},{\"url\":\"/uploads/hero_australia_melbourne_1920x1080.jpg\"},{\"url\":\"/uploads/hero_australia_anu_unsw_1920x1080.jpg\"},{\"url\":\"/uploads/images__1__1791697548087.jpg\"},{\"url\":\"/uploads/hero_uk_cambridge_1920x1080.jpg\"}]},\"stats\":[{\"number\":\"5,000+\",\"label\":\"Students Placed\"},{\"number\":\"98.6%\",\"label\":\"Visa Approval Rate\"},{\"number\":\"120+\",\"label\":\"Partner Universities\"},{\"number\":\"$14.2M+\",\"label\":\"Scholarships Secured\"}],\"sections\":[{\"id\":\"hero\",\"name\":\"Hero Banner\",\"enabled\":true,\"order\":1},{\"id\":\"marquee\",\"name\":\"Partner University Ticker\",\"enabled\":true,\"order\":2},{\"id\":\"pathway\",\"name\":\"4-Step Journey Pathway\",\"enabled\":true,\"order\":3},{\"id\":\"destinations\",\"name\":\"Study Destinations Showcase\",\"enabled\":true,\"order\":4},{\"id\":\"services\",\"name\":\"Services Portfolio\",\"enabled\":true,\"order\":5},{\"id\":\"universities\",\"name\":\"Top Universities Spotlight\",\"enabled\":true,\"order\":6},{\"id\":\"calculator\",\"name\":\"Admission & Visa Calculator\",\"enabled\":true,\"order\":7},{\"id\":\"stories\",\"name\":\"Success Stories & Videos\",\"enabled\":true,\"order\":8},{\"id\":\"why_us\",\"name\":\"Why Students Trust AuraGlobal\",\"enable